    q: [What does photosynthesis need?],
    a: block-left[
      Plants need *light*, *water* and *carbon dioxide*. With the energy of the
      light they make *glucose* and give off *oxygen*:
      $ 6 "CO"_2 + 6 "H"_2"O" -> "C"_6"H"_12"O"_6 + 6 "O"_2 $
      This happens in the *chloroplasts*, mainly in the leaves.
    ],
  ),
